title: "db2bibtex: export HJA/LTER publications from SQL Server to BibTeX for Zotero"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndrewsForestLTER/db2bibtex"
authors:
  - family-names: Kennedy
    given-names: Adam
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0491-8412"
    affiliation: "H.J. Andrews Experimental Forest LTER, Oregon State University"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22800301
    description: "Concept DOI — always resolves to the latest version"
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22800302
    description: "Version DOI for v1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Exports Published H.J. Andrews Experimental Forest and Long-Term
  Ecological Research (LTER) publications from a SQL Server publication
  database to BibTeX, for import into Zotero. Provides both a
  command-line interface and a tkinter GUI. Table and column names are
  configured via a user-supplied query file (query.sql), not hardcoded,
  so the tool can be adapted to other institutions' schemas. This
  material is based upon work supported by the H.J. Andrews Experimental
  Forest and Long Term Ecological Research (LTER) program under the NSF
  grant LTER8 DEB-2025755.
keywords:
  - BibTeX
  - Zotero
  - SQL Server
  - bibliography
  - LTER
  - data management
